{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squared Notebook Fight</strong> is a hand-drawn, fast-paced top-down bullet hell shooter where chaos erupts right on the pages of a school notebook. You control a doodled character, fending off waves of enemies and flying ink bullets through short but intense runs. Collect coins and exchange them for shields, health, or new weapons. Upgrade your hero to boost their combat abilities in the next round. Victory goes to those who aren\u2019t afraid of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm. Shoot. Loot. Die. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355010/extras/87fb68b85510e61966819a3a59418a80.poster.avif?t=1754601081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355010/extras/87fb68b85510e61966819a3a59418a80.webm?t=1754601081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355010/extras/87fb68b85510e61966819a3a59418a80.mp4?t=1754601081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual style</strong> \u2013 Everything looks like it\u2019s drawn in a squared notebook, filled with lively hand-drawn doodles and scribbles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom characters</strong> \u2013 Draw your very own playable character directly in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense gameplay</strong> \u2013 Fast bullet hell experience with enemy waves, projectiles flying from all directions, and zero downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> \u2013 Collect ink-based currency, upgrade abilities, and strengthen your hero with each new run.</p></li></ul>","background":